{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1c8aea97-2bc0-8042-b4bd-b587c6a3d078",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T16:05:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:03:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:03:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. Um, I'm calling about a fence, I think. Or a pool. It's, you know, kind of both. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let's take it one at a time. Are you building a pool, and the fence would go around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, yeah, I'm building a pool. In the backyard. And I'm wondering about the barrier rules, I mean, what you need around it. Do you follow me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. Pools generally need a barrier around them. What kind of fence were you planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Chain-link. Six feet tall. I figured six is, you know, plenty high. Is that the, is that the rule? Six?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six feet is a common height, but the exact barrier requirements, like gate latches and spacing, are something the inspector goes over with you. The bigger answer to your question is yes, a fence generally needs a permit, and a pool does too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:04:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the fence needs its own permit. Wait, or is it one permit for the whole pool thing? I mean, I thought the fence was just part of the pool."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:04:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. They're often reviewed together with the pool application, but the fence is still part of what gets approved. Do you have a contractor doing the work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I got a contractor. So does he pull the permit, or do I? Like, who's, who's supposed to do that? Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either can. Many contractors do it for you, but the owner is ultimately responsible, so ask him directly and get it in writing who is filing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Sorry, one sec. [pause] My neighbor just brought over a plate of cookies, she's at the door. Okay. Where was I. How long does approval take? Like, days, weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on how complete the application is and how busy we are. Figure a couple of weeks, sometimes less, but you can't start building until it's approved. Winter can be a little slower for the pool side anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:05:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. So, I mean, to be clear, fence needs a permit, talk to the contractor about who files. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Do you want me to leave a callback number in case the inspector wants to follow up with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:05:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0177."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:05:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0177. Someone will reach out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T16:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. I think I get it. Mostly. Thanks."
    }
  ],
